@startuml
[*] --> StartupCheck
StartupCheck --> Ready : everything is fine
StartupCheck --> Stopped : problem during startup
Ready --> Ready : user reset
Ready --> Activated : user activate
Ready --> Stopped : user turn off
Activated --> Monitoring
Monitoring --> Alarm : sensor triggered
Monitoring --> Monitoring : false alarm or time ends
Alarm --> Monitoring : false alarm or time ends
Monitoring --> Stopped : user enters password
Stopped --> [*]
@enduml
